## Changes Made

### Feature 1: High-Concurrency Custom Alias Management

#### [SqliteUrlRepository.cs](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/src/UrlShortener/Infrastructure/Persistence/SqliteUrlRepository.cs)
- **Wrapped** `SaveChangesAsync` in `try-catch(DbUpdateException)` to catch UNIQUE constraint violations (SQLite error codes 19/2067).
- Retained `AnyAsync` as fast-path optimization; the unique index is now the authoritative enforcement.
- On `DbUpdateException`, re-throws as `InvalidOperationException` with the same message format as the pre-check path.

#### [UrlEndpoints.cs](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/src/UrlShortener.Api/Endpoints/UrlEndpoints.cs)
- 409 Conflict responses now use RFC 7807 `ProblemDetails` via `Results.Problem()` with `title: "Alias Conflict"`.
- Added `.ProducesProblem(StatusCodes.Status409Conflict)` to endpoint metadata.

